      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The scaler converts the horizontal component of each value in [`motionTexture`](mtlfxtemporaldenoisedscalerbase/motiontexture.md) into fragment (pixel) coordinates by multiplying it by this property’s value.",
      "normalizedSource": "The scaler converts the horizontal component of each value in [`motionTexture`](mtlfxtemporaldenoisedscalerbase/motiontexture.md) into fragment (pixel) coordinates by multiplying it by this property’s value.",
